    "Nxe5 Bxb7 Qxb7 dxe5 and Nxe5 dxe5 Bxd5 Qxd5 both balance material. Truncating the second exchange before Qxd5 invented a profit. White is already favoured, so a negative Black score is not evidence that Nxe5 newly loses.",
